          <p source="#source-84012-84141"><seg source="#source-84012-84063">道路に落ちたるを乞ふべけんや。　　</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-84063-84141" corresp="#source-84063-84096 #source-84108-84141"><seg source="#source-84096-84108">（後略）</seg></hi></p>
