        <div>
          <p source="#source-245652-245681"><seg source="#source-245652-245681">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245681-245710"><seg source="#source-245681-245710">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245710-245739"><seg source="#source-245710-245739">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245739-245768"><seg source="#source-245739-245768">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245768-245797"><seg source="#source-245768-245797">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245797-245826"><seg source="#source-245797-245826">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245826-245855"><seg source="#source-245826-245855">いちめんのなのはな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245855-245884"><seg source="#source-245855-245884">かすかなるむぎぶえ</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-245884-245998"><seg source="#source-245884-245920">いちめんのなのはな　　　</seg><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-245920-245998" corresp="#source-245920-245953 #source-245965-245998"><seg source="#source-245953-245965">（後略）</seg></hi></p>
